 outgoing person. When participating in a meetup event held by Yuki, she calls herself \"Shinju.\" She likes drawing, when she was young, she was very talented and had won awards in several contests, however, she seemed to have quit once she started going to school."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"The feather in her possession is called \"Astra.\""}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c133398"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"梯子やユキとは別の学校に通う高等部２年生の女子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"内気というよりは極度な人見知りで、陽キャを見るとひどく怯える。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ユキが開いたオフ会に参加した際は、「シンジュ」と名乗った。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"絵を描くのが好きで、幼い頃はコンクールで賞を取るほどの才覚を見せていたが、進学を機に辞めてしまったようだ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"所持している羽根は『星≪アストラ≫』"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"25826","sourceWorkId":"35638","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"梯子やユキとは別の学校に通う高等部２年生の女子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"内気というよりは極度な人見知りで、陽キャを見るとひどく怯える。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ユキが開いたオフ会に参加した際は、「シンジュ」と名乗った。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"絵を描くのが好きで、幼い頃はコンクールで賞を取るほどの才覚を見せていたが、進学を機に辞めてしまったようだ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"所持している羽根は『星《アストラ》』"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"148730"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/cc/cce6208429e8ce356b45b46169af06b84110943d90ba4646677291d4d5498251.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f0/f00db13e2c21b276a865e4ff30da8f56cc849551825f536d8521d4f05278c654.webp","width":147,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"空賀花","creatorId":"vndb:s15476","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s15476","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s15476","name":"空賀 花","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:471237:148730:34089:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c133399","characterName":"天使","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"148729","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"471237"}],"egsCharacterIds":["25825"],"vndbCharacterId":"c133399"},"originalCharacterName":"天使","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A girl with one wing. She calls herself Tenshi, but whether she has a real name or not is unknown. By flapping her wing, she is able to float slightly. Working part-time, storing a large amount of cup noodles, she lives a surprisingly down-to-earth life. Sometimes, as if she remembers something, she tends to look up at the sky, reaching out her hand."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c133399"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"半分だけ翼の生えた少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"天使と名乗り、本名の有無は不明。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"翼を羽ばたかせることで、少しだけ浮くことが出来る。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"バイトをしたり、カップ麺を大量に備蓄していたりと、意外にも地に足付いた生活をしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"時々思い出したように高所で空を見上げ、届かない手を伸ばす。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"25825","sourceWorkId":"35638","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"半分だけ翼の生えた少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"天使と名乗り、本名の有無は不明。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"翼を羽ばたかせることで、少しだけ浮くことが出来る。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"バイトをしたり、カップ麺を大量に備蓄していたりと、意外にも地に足付いた生活をしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"時々思い出したように高所で空を見上げ、届かない手を伸ばす。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"148729"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d3/d3da8b4a74a112bfb7232022432d5dc468c6c989da37d2fbff74022df2718f73.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/56/56fd73c81b9d2498499eee8ce7ef5942173a7f31a729e13a3568718cc081ae9c.webp","width":147,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"間宮菜南子","creatorId":"vndb:s999","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s999","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s999","name":"間宮 菜南子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:471237:148729:15995:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c133400","characterName":"宵宮 梯子","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"148735","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"471237"}],"egsCharacterIds":["25831"],"vndbCharacterId":"c133400"},"originalCharacterName":"宵宮 梯子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The protagonist of the story. He is a second-year student at a school in the city. In the past, he was expected to be the ace of the archery club, but due to an accident, he stopped going to school. After that, he could not stand being in his room, so he began to walk around the city every evening. Nonetheless, he had reached his limit and decided to leave the house. After meeting Tenshi in an abandoned building, he is given a miracle feather that can transform reality."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"The feather in his possession is called \"Lumen.\""}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c133400"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"物語の主人公。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"都内の学校に所属する高等部２年生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"以前は弓道部で実力も期待されていたが、ある出来事から不登校になってしまった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"それからは部屋にいることに耐えられず毎日夕暮れから夜の街を歩いていたが、それにも限界が来て家を出ることを決意する。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"廃墟で天使に出逢い、現実を一変させる奇跡の羽根を手に入れる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"所持している羽根は『光≪ルーメン≫』"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"25831","sourceWorkId":"35638","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"物語の主人公。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"都内の学校に所属する高等部２年生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"以前は弓道部で実力も期待されていたが、ある出来事から不登校になってしまった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"それからは部屋にいることに耐えられず毎日夕暮れから夜の街を歩いていたが、それにも限界が来て家を出ることを決意する。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"廃墟で天使に出逢い、現実を一変させる奇跡の羽根を手に入れる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"所持している羽根は『光《ルーメン》』"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"148735"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ed/eda5b9f90401ecca82732c1bb12ccb70e1f607a57ec87101487e633fe076fb51.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a5/a5c3b4f075adeef8bb9bcd128dacbfee8dc401b10001647a85c0ddce8e96770f.webp","width":192,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_c133401","characterName":"九条 希望","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"148734","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"471237"}],"egsCharacterIds":["25830"],"vndbCharacterId":"c133401"},"originalCharacterName":"九条 希望","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A classmate attending the same school as Hashigo, and a boy who used to be his best friend. Since they were in the same archery club, they used to hang out everyday, but due to a certain incident, their relationship has broken apart. At the moment, he is the last person Hashigo wants to see."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c133401"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"梯子と同じ学校に通う同級生で、かつての親友。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"同じ弓道部だったこともあり以前は梯子と毎日のように話す仲だったが、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"とある出来事をきっかけにその関係は破綻してしまう。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"25830","sourceWorkId":"35638","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"梯子と同じ学校に通う同級生で、かつての親友。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"同じ弓道部だったこともあり以前は梯子と毎日のように話す仲だったが、とある出来事をきっかけにその関係は破綻してしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"今では、梯子が最も会いたくない人物である。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"148734"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{"sex":[{"comparisonValue":"m","source":"vndb","