け回っている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"25829","sourceWorkId":"35638","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"梯子と同じ学校に通う同級生で、かつての想い人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"明るく人当りが良いので、学校内ではアイドル視され人気がある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"女子弓道部の部長と委員長を担っていて、毎日忙しそうに駆け回っている。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"148732"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b8/b88b45118ba524a450e16e237349bbe2a9c46645ab8187a607958ba905feab5f.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f1/f1209a90c5af06e2e3187752671598868d89ac977e3f504e46f2fee96faa3da6.webp","width":147,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"柚原みう","creatorId":"vndb:s977","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s977","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s977","name":"柚原 みう","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:471237:148732:15162:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c133403","characterName":"八雲 あめ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"148731","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"471237"}],"egsCharacterIds":["25828"],"vndbCharacterId":"c133403"},"originalCharacterName":"八雲 あめ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"When Hashigo was hospitalized, she took care of him as an intern, but has now became an official nurse. Although she looks beautiful and could be mistaken for a model, her personality takes a 180 degrees turn during her private life. She is often misunderstood because of how harshly she treats other people, especially those that are not close to her. But in spite of that, she had the kindness to reach out to a depressed boy and save his heart, even if only a little."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c133403"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"梯子が入院していた際、看護実習生として関わっていた現・看護師。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"モデルに間違われるほどの美貌を持つが、仕事とプライベートで性格が１８０度違う。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"特に親しくない相手にはキツイ当たり方をするので誤解されることも多々…。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかしその奥には、塞ぎ込んでいた少年に毎日話し掛け僅かにでもその心を救った優しさがある。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"25828","sourceWorkId":"35638","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"梯子が入院していた際、看護実習生として関わっていた現・看護師。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"モデルに間違われるほどの美貌を持つが、仕事とプライベートで性格が１８０度違う。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"特に親しくない相手にはキツイ当たり方をするので誤解されることも多々…。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかしその奥には、塞ぎ込んでいた少年に毎日話し掛け僅かにでもその心を救った優しさがある。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"148731"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/2e/2ee01cc31451cd388983af7a1af5df91a36391efebfb433f089773947893a056.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b2/b28d46b81ee8c0174243fb40b6ed719e6c3822f34289ebd550b9c653e8a16964.webp","width":147,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"中村麻未","creatorId":"vndb:s980","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s980","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s980","name":"中村 麻未","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:471237:148731:15637:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c133404","characterName":"ソーダ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"148733","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"471237"}],"egsCharacterIds":["25827"],"vndbCharacterId":"c133404"},"originalCharacterName":"ソーダ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A tall, good-looking, and refreshing third-year student, who attends a different school from Hashigo and Shizuku. He has both cheerful and calm sides, and is popular with everyone. At the \"Meetup Event for People with Feathers,\" which he held, he calls himself \"Soda.\" Since he has left his parents and lived alone independently, Hashigo thinks of him as his role model. However, on occasion, he appears to be haunted by the shadow of a woman...."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"The feather in his possession is called \"Glacies.\""}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c133404"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"梯子や雫とは別の学校に通う、長身イケメンの爽やかな男子学生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"高等部３年生で、他２人よりも１年先輩。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"明るさと落ち着いた一面の両方を持ち、男女問わず人気者。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自身で開いた『羽根を持った人間を集めたオフ会』では「ソーダ」と名乗った。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"親元を離れ自立し一人暮らしをしているので、梯子にとっては憧れの存在でもある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし時折、女性の影に悩まされているようで…。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"所持している羽根は『冰≪グラキエス≫』"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"25827","sourceWorkId":"35638","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"梯子や雫とは別の学校に通う、長身イケメンの爽やかな高等部３年生の男子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"明るさと落ち着いた一面の両方を持ち、男女問わず人気者。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自身で開いた『羽根を持った人間を集めたオフ会』では「ソーダ」と名乗った。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"親元を離れ自立し一人暮らしをしているので、梯子にとっては憧れの存在でもある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし時折、女性の影に悩まされているようで…。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"所持している羽根は『冰≪グラキエス≫』"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"148733"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0b/0bd1be0b1fba2fcdebd621e26a4ef9c154ee708ad4c3ad8121be94904da6a574.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fc/fcb5f37c5e433b3a0e984127e6ed5c5a598dd1bd1b49726bcdf381bd0a57a2d2.webp","width":147,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"小林優希","creatorId":"vndb:s21651","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s21651","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s21651","name":"小林 優希